Applies the first item of its input to the second. The tests pass functions as input: one is imported, from the library, and one is written inline. The import is in scope for the tests as well as the program.
---
triple = lib/triple.prog
---
(lam p ((head p) (tail p)))
---
[triple 4] => 12 fuel 100000
[(lam x (+ x 1)) 4] => 5 fuel 100000
[(lam x (head x)) 4] => error fuel 100000
